     </tr>\n\n          <tr>\n            <th>Weight</th>\n            <td>82 g</td>\n          </tr>\n\n          <tr>\n            <th>Grayscale Levels</th>\n            <td>2-level, 3-level, and 4-level grayscale</td>\n          </tr>\n\n          <tr>\n            <th>Recommended Ink Viscosity</th>\n            <td>3–4 mPa·s</td>\n          </tr>\n        </tbody>\n      </table>\n    </div>\n\n    <p class=\"desceci-i3200-specs__note\">\n      Specifications are provided for reference. Always confirm printer compatibility,\n      connector configuration, and installation requirements before ordering.\n    </p>\n\n  </div>\n</section>",
