n        Confirm Compatibility Before Installation\n      </h2>\n\n      <p class=\"desceci-i3200-compatibility__intro\">\n        Printhead compatibility depends on your printer configuration,\n        ink system, wiring, and installation setup.\n      </p>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"desceci-i3200-compatibility__steps\">\n\n      <div class=\"desceci-i3200-compatibility__step\">\n        <span class=\"desceci-i3200-compatibility__step-number\">01</span>\n\n        <h3>Check Your Printer Model</h3>\n\n        <p>\n          Confirm that your printer is designed for an Epson I3200-A1\n          printhead before placing your order.\n        </p>\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"desceci-i3200-compatibility__step\">\n        <span class=\"desceci-i3200-compatibility__step-number\">02</span>\n\n        <h3>Verify Ink Compatibility</h3>\n\n        <p>\n          This printhead is intended for compatible aqueous pigment ink\n          systems. Confirm the ink type and recommended viscosity.\n        </p>\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"desceci-i3200-compatibility__step\">\n        <span class=\"desceci-i3200-compatibility__step-number\">03</span>\n\n        <h3>Use Professional Installation</h3>\n\n        <p>\n          Proper installation, wiring, flushing, and calibration are\n          important for stable print quality and reliable performance.\n        </p>\n      </div>\n\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"desceci-i3200-compatibility__warning\">\n      <strong>Important:</strong>\n      Printheads are precision components. Please compare the model,\n      connector configuration, ink system, and printer settings before ordering.\n      Damage caused by incorrect installation or incompatible ink may not be covered.\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"desceci-i3200-compatibility__contact\">\n      <div class=\"desceci-i3200-compatibility__contact-text\">\n        <h3>Not Sure Which Printhead You Need?</h3>\n\n        <p>\n          Send us your printer model and ink system. Our team will help you\n          confirm compatibility before you place your order.\n        </p>\n      </div>\n\n      <a\n        href=\"mailto:desceci@outloonk.com?subject=I3200-A1%20Printhead%20Compatibility%20Question\"\n        class=\"desceci-i3200-compatibility__email\">\n        Email Us for Help\n      </a>\n    </div>\n\n  </div>\n</section>",
