      "type": "custom-liquid",
      "name": "Installation & Maintenance Tips",
      "settings": {
        "custom_liquid": "<style>\n  .desceci-i3200-maintenance {\n    width: 100%;\n    padding: 76px 20px;\n    background: #f7f9fc;\n    font-family: Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\n  }\n\n  .desceci-i3200-maintenance__container {\n    max-width: 1120px;\n    margin: 0 auto;\n  }\n\n  .desceci-i3200-maintenance__header {\n    max-width: 760px;\n    margin: 0 auto 42px;\n    text-align: center;\n  }\n\n  .desceci-i3200-maintenance__eyebrow {\n    margin: 0 0 13px;\n    color: #5c9143;\n    font-size: 13px;\n    font-weight: 700;\n    letter-spacing: 1.8px;\n    text-transform: uppercase;\n  }\n\n  .desceci-i3200-maintenance h2 {\n    margin: 0 0 15px;\n    color: #15243a;\n    font-size: 36px;\n    font-weight: 700;\n    line-height: 1.2;\n  }\n\n  .desceci-i3200-maintenance__intro {\n    margin: 0;\n    color: #697586;\n    font-size: 16px;\n    line-height: 1.7;\n  }\n\n  .desceci-i3200-maintenance__list {\n    display: grid;\n    grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr);\n    gap: 18px 22px;\n  }\n\n  .desceci-i3200-maintenance__item {\n    display: grid;\n    grid-template-columns: 48px 1fr;\n    gap: 17px;\n    align-items: start;\n    padding: 25px 24px;\n    border: 1px solid #e0e6ec;\n    border-radius: 6px;\n    background: #ffffff;\n  }\n\n  .desceci-i3200-maintenance__icon {\n    display: flex;\n    width: 42px;\n    height: 42px;\n    align-items: center;\n    justify-content: center;\n    border-radius: 50%;\n    background: #e8f1e3;\n    color: #5c9143;\n    font-size: 18px;\n    font-weight: 700;\n  }\n\n  .desceci-i3200-maintenance__item h3 {\n    margin: 0 0 8px;\n    color: #15243a;\n    font-size: 17px;\n    line-height: 1.4;\n  }\n\n  .desceci-i3200-maintenance__item p {\n    margin: 0;\n    color: #697586;\n    font-size: 14px;\n    line-height: 1.7;\n  }\n\n  .desceci-i3200-maintenance__bottom-note {\n    margin-top: 28px;\n    padding: 20px 24px;\n    border-radius: 6px;\n    background: #15243a;\n    color: #dce5ef;\n    font-size: 14px;\n    line-height: 1.7;\n    text-align: center;\n  }\n\n  .desceci-i3200-maintenance__bottom-note strong {\n    color: #ffffff;\n  }\n\n  @media screen and (max-width: 700px) {\n    .desceci-i3200-maintenance {\n      padding: 55px 16px;\n    }\n\n    .desceci-i3200-maintenance h2 {\n      font-size: 29px;\n    }\n\n    .desceci-i3200-maintenance__intro {\n      font-size: 15px;\n    }\n\n    .desceci-i3200-maintenance__list {\n      grid-template-columns: 1fr;\n      gap: 12px;\n    }\n\n    .desceci-i3200-maintenance__item {\n      grid-template-columns: 42px 1fr;\n      padding: 21px 18px;\n    }\n  }\n</style>\n\n<section class=\"desceci-i3200-maintenance\">\n  <div class=\"desceci-i3200-maintenance__container\">\n\n    <div class=\"desceci-i3200-maintenance__header\">\n      <p class=\"desceci-i3200-maintenance__eyebrow\">\n        INSTALLATION & CARE\n      </p>\n\n      <h2>\n        Protect Your Printhead Performance\n      </h2>\n\n      <p class=\"desceci-i3200-maintenance__intro\">\n        Proper preparation and routine maintenance help support stable ink flow,\n        reliable printing, and longer printhead service life.\n      </p>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"desceci-i3200-maintenance__list\">\n\n      <div class=\"desceci-i3200-maintenance__item\">\n        <div class=\"desceci-i3200-maintenance__icon\">01</div>\n\n        <div>\n          <h3>Flush the Ink System</h3>\n\n          <p>\n            Flush incompatible or dried ink from the ink path before installing\n            the new printhead.\n          </p>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"desceci-i3200-maintenance__item\">\n        <div class=\"desceci-i3200-maintenance__icon\">02</div>\n\n        <div>\n          <h3>Check Wiring Carefully</h3>\n\n          <p>\n            Confirm the connector direction and wiring configuration before\n            powering on the printer.\n          </p>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"desceci-i3200-maintenance__item\">\n        <div class=\"desceci-i3200-maintenance__icon\">03</div>\n\n        <div>\n          <h3>Prime and Calibrate</h3>\n\n          <p>\n            Prime the ink system and complete nozzle checks, alignment,\n            and calibration before production printing.\n          </p>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"desceci-i3200-maintenance__item\">\n        <div class=\"desceci-i3200-maintenance__icon\">04</div>\n\n        <div>\n          <h3>Keep the Nozzle Surface Clean</h3>\n\n          <p>\n            Follow the printer manufacturer’s cleaning procedure and prevent\n            ink from drying on the nozzle surface.\n          </p>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"desceci-i3200-maintenance__bottom-note\">\n      <strong>Recommended:</strong>\n      Run a nozzle check before important production jobs and keep the printer\n      in a clean, stable environment.\n    </div>\n\n  </div>\n</section>",
